msgstr ""
"Audiovisuaalset materjali jagatakse ainult juhul, kui te annate oma "
"nõusoleku täiendava nõusolekuvormi abil, nagu on selgitatud eespool."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we may share your audio-visual material along with fully "
"anonymized data, such as demographic, aggregated, or extracted data."
msgstr ""
"Sellistel juhtudel võime jagada teie audiovisuaalset materjali koos "
"täielikult anonüümsete andmetega, näiteks demograafiliste, agregeeritud või "
"ekstraheeritud andmetega."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"We will never connect your real name or any of your personal information "
"directly to your image or sound recording, even though it is off course "
"possible to recognize individuals based on audio-visual material."
msgstr ""
"Me ei seosta kunagi teie tegelikku nime ega mingeid isikuandmeid otse teie "
"pildi või helisalvestusega, kuigi loomulikult on võimalik isikuid "
"audiovisuaalse materjali põhjal ära tunda."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All the recordings we obtain during this research will be kept confidential,"
" and nobody outside the group of researchers will be able to share or store "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Kõik salvestused, mida me selle uuringu käigus saame, hoitakse "
"konfidentsiaalsena ning keegi väljaspool uurimisrühma ei saa neid jagada ega"
" salvestada."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your recordings to derive your real "
"identity, personal information could be leaked if you are not in an isolated"
" environment."
msgstr ""
"Kuigi teadlased ei kasuta teie salvestusi teie tegeliku identiteedi "
"tuletamiseks, võivad isikuandmed lekkida, kui te ei ole isoleeritud "
"keskkonnas."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"By consenting to this experiment, you are committing not to use profanity "
"while recording audio or nudity while recording video."
msgstr ""
"Nõustudes selle eksperimendi läbiviimisega, võtate endale kohustuse mitte "
"kasutada helisalvestuse ajal rõvedust või videosalvestuse ajal alastust."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"For example, you may want to sit in a room that is isolated from the rest of"
" the house."
msgstr "Näiteks võite istuda toas, mis on ülejäänud majast isoleeritud."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, in some experiments, your recordings may be seen or heard by other "
"participants in order to evaluate them in different attributes or create new"
" materials (for example replicate a rhythm that you created, or continue a "
"melody that you sang)."
msgstr ""
"Mõnes eksperimendis võivad teie salvestusi siiski näha või kuulda teised "
"osalejad, et hinnata neid erinevate tunnuste järgi või luua uusi materjale "
"(näiteks korrata teie loodud rütmi või jätkata lauletud meloodiat)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If you choose to participate in the experiment, it is important and your "
"responsibility to make sure that while you record audio and video nothing "
"that you don’t intend to be recorded is recorded."
msgstr ""
"Kui otsustate eksperimendis osaleda, on oluline ja teie vastutusel tagada, "
"et heli- ja videosalvestuse ajal ei salvestataks midagi sellist, mida te ei "
"kavatse salvestada."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Raw audio/video will not be shared with collaborators (we will only share "
"extracted data from recordings without personal identifiers)."
msgstr ""
"Toores audio/video ei jagata kaastöötajatega (me jagame ainult väljavõetud "
"andmeid salvestustest ilma isiklike identifikaatoriteta)."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"You may wish to make sure that no sounds/visual material in your environment"
" could be linked to your personal information. In addition, while you "
"perform a recording, the microphone or camera can capture unintended audio "
"or video, for example the camera can capture another family member, or the "
"microphone can capture something you say to another person."
msgstr ""
"Võite veenduda, et teie keskkonnas ei ole heli/visuaalset materjali, mida "
"saaks seostada teie isikuandmetega. Lisaks võib mikrofon või kaamera "
"salvestamise ajal jäädvustada tahtmatult heli või videot, näiteks võib "
"kaamera jäädvustada teist pereliiget või mikrofon võib jäädvustada midagi, "
"mida te teisele isikule ütlete."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be associated with your name or other identifiers "
"in any way."
msgstr ""
"Teie salvestusi ei seostata mingil viisil teie nime või muude tunnustega."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Your recordings will not be used to derive your real identity, and they will"
" not be made public."
msgstr ""
"Teie salvestusi ei kasutata teie tegeliku identiteedi tuvastamiseks ja neid "
"ei avalikustata."

#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "consent-consent"
msgid ""
"By consenting to participate, you acknowledge that you are 18 years or "
"older, have read this consent form, agree to its contents, and agree to take"
